<section class="panel active" id="home">
<div class="home-heading"><div><h2>Your day, in bloom.</h2><p class="subtitle">Your daily check-in</p></div><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="focusHomeChat()">✦ Chat</button></div>
<div class="home-steps card"><div class="row"><div><div class="small">👟 Steps today</div><div class="number" id="homeStepCount">—</div></div><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="toggleSteps()">Update →</button></div><div id="homeStepEditor" class="hide"><label for="homeStepInput">Steps today</label><input class="field" id="homeStepInput" type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Enter steps"><div class="actions"><button class="btn small" onclick="saveHomeSteps()">Save steps</button><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="toggleSteps(false)">Cancel</button></div></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" id="homeStepFill"></div></div><div class="small" id="homeStepCaption"></div></div>
<div class="home-two"><div class="card"><div class="small">💧 Fluids</div><div class="number" id="homeFluidCount"></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" id="homeFluidFill"></div></div><div class="fluid-quick"><button onclick="addWater(8)">+ 8 oz</button><button onclick="addWater(12)">+ 12 oz</button><button onclick="addWater(23.67)">+ 700 mL</button></div></div><div class="card"><div class="small">♧ Workout</div><div id="movement"></div></div></div>
<section class="card home-section" id="homeSupplements"><h3>Supplements taken today</h3><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="prenatalCheck" onchange="saveSupp()"> Prenatal (includes folate, iron, DHA, vitamin D, iodine, calcium, magnesium)</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="cholineCheck" onchange="saveSupp()"> Separate choline supplement (combined choline supplement total 265 mg when both taken)</label><p class="small">Choline supplement amount is counted as 265 mg only when both boxes are checked.</p></section> <section class="card home-section" id="homeChat"><h3>✦ Ask Bloom</h3><p class="small">Paste foods from ChatGPT here. Multiple foods will save separately.</p><div id="messages"></div><div class="chatbox"><textarea id="chatInput" rows="3" placeholder="Paste multiple BLOOM FOOD entries, or type a quick update" aria-label="Message Bloom"></textarea><button type="button" aria-label="Send" onclick="chatSend()">↑</button></div></section>
<section class="card home-section" id="quickFood"><h3>🍓 Quick food log</h3><p class="small">Find a food, reuse a recent entry, or save a favorite meal. Review nutrition before adding.</p><input class="field" id="quickFoodSearch" placeholder="Search foods, e.g. egg, beans, salmon" oninput="bloomQuickRender()"><div class="quickfood-tabs"><button type="button" onclick="bloomQuickTab('search')" id="qtab_search">Search</button><button type="button" onclick="bloomQuickTab('recent')" id="qtab_recent">Recent</button><button type="button" onclick="bloomQuickTab('saved')" id="qtab_saved">Saved meals</button></div><div id="quickFoodResults" class="quickfood-results"></div><div id="quickFoodEditor"></div><details style="margin-top:16px"><summary style="font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">✦ Try describing what you ate</summary><p class="quickfood-help">Experimental: recognizes a few common foods and estimates nutrition without sending your text anywhere. It is not AI and may miss ingredients. Review each estimate.</p><textarea class="field" id="quickFoodNatural" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. 2 eggs and 1 cup cooked spaghetti"></textarea><button class="btn small" onclick="bloomEstimateText()">Estimate foods</button><div id="quickFoodEstimate"></div></details><p class="quickfood-help" style="margin-top:12px">Nutrition values are estimates. Saved foods and meals stay in this browser with your Bloom data.</p></section><div class="card home-section"><div class="row"><h3>Daily nutrition</h3><button class="text-link" onclick="document.getElementById('homeNutrients').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">See nutrients ↓</button></div><div class="metrics" id="metrics"></div></div>
<div class="card home-section"><div class="row"><h3>Food log</h3></div><div id="homeFoodLog"></div></div>
<div class="card home-section"><div class="row"><h3>Key nutrients</h3></div><div class="key-nutrients" id="homeNutrients"></div><p class="small">Still tracking means some food nutrients are unknown, not that you are deficient.</p><details><summary class="text-link">Food vs supplements details</summary><div id="nutrientsHome"></div></details></div>

<div id="nutrientHighlights" class="hide"></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="insights"><h2>Your progress.</h2><p class="subtitle">Your weekly averages and trends, all in one place.</p><h3>Progress at a glance</h3><div class="card" id="homeProgress"></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="log"><h2>Food & fluids</h2><p class="subtitle">Your daily log and food-based nutrients.</p><div class="card"><h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick add fluids</h3><div class="actions"><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="addWater(12)">+ 12 oz</button><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="addWater(23.67)">+ 700 mL</button><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="addWater(8)">+ 8 oz</button></div></div><div class="card" style="display:none"><h3 style="margin-top:0">Add food or drink</h3><label>Description</label><input class="field" id="foodName" placeholder="e.g. Vanilla protein shake"><div class="two"><div><label>Calories</label><input class="field" id="cal" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div><div><label>Protein (g)</label><input class="field" id="protein" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div><div><label>Fiber (g)</label><input class="field" id="fiber" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div><div><label>Fluids (oz)</label><input class="field" id="fluid" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div></div><details><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Food micronutrients (optional)</summary><div class="two" id="microInputs"></div><p class="small">Leave unavailable values blank. Unknown does not mean zero.</p></details><button class="btn" onclick="addFood()">Add to today's log</button></div><h3>Today's entries</h3><div class="card" id="entries"></div><h3>Food vs supplements</h3><div class="card" id="nutrients"></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="workouts"><h2>Move your way.</h2><p class="subtitle">You choose what to do and when. No assigned daily workouts.</p>
