<div style="display:none"><div class="card"><div class="row"><b id="workoutTitle"></b><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="document.getElementById('editPlan').classList.toggle('hide')">✎ Edit</button></div><div class="schedule-actions"><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="openReschedule()">↪ Reschedule</button><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="skipWorkout()">Skip today</button></div><div id="rescheduleBox" class="hide" style="margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:var(--mint);border-radius:14px"><label>Move this workout to</label><input class="field" type="date" id="moveDate"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="swapWorkouts"> Swap with workout on destination date</label><p class="small">Without swapping, both workouts will appear on the destination date.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn small" onclick="moveWorkout()">Confirm move</button><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="closeReschedule()">Cancel</button></div></div><div id="workoutChecks"></div><div id="editPlan" class="hide"><hr class="divider"><label>Workout title</label><input class="field" id="planTitle"><div id="editExercises"></div><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="addExerciseRow()">+ Exercise</button> <button class="btn small" onclick="savePlan()">Save plan</button></div></div><div class="card"><h3 style="margin-top:0">Daily mobility + pelvic floor</h3><div id="mobilityChecks"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="panel" id="settings"><h2>Bloom settings</h2><p class="subtitle">Your goals and your data.</p><div class="card"><b>My goals</b><p class="small">Edit here or tell Bloom in Chat, for example “Change my weekly step goal to 60000”.</p><div class="goal-grid" id="goalInputs"></div><button class="btn small" onclick="saveGoals()">Save goals</button><p class="small" id="goalSaved" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="card"><b>Back up your data</b><p class="small">Entries are saved in this browser on this device. Export regularly, especially before switching files or devices.</p><button class="btn secondary small" onclick="exportData()">Export JSON backup</button> <label class="btn secondary small" style="display:inline-block;cursor:pointer">Import backup<input type="file" accept="application/json" style="display:none" onchange="importData(event)"></label></div><div class="notice">Bloom is a local prototype. It does not automatically sync with this ChatGPT conversation, Apple Health, or other devices. Nutrient values are estimates and not medical advice.</div></section></main><nav class="nav"><div class="navinner"><button data-tab="home" class="active" onclick="tab('home')"><b>⌂</b>Home</button><button data-tab="workouts" onclick="tab('workouts')"><b>♧</b>Workouts</button><button data-tab="insights" onclick="tab('insights')"><b>▥</b>Progress</button></div></nav>
